{"product_id":"nasty-shisha-nic-salt-double-apple","title":"Nasty Shisha Nic Salt - Double Apple","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/nasty-nic-salts\" title=\"Nasty Salts\"\u003eNasty Salts\u003c\/a\u003e Double Apple is from their new Shisha Series and features the infamous and all time favorite flavor of double apple in salt nicotine form.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eWe could be mistaken in saying that the double apple flavor here is based on the famous Al-Fakher Double Apple flavor. Or perhaps it could be from the Nakhla Double Apple flavor. Whichever it is, we think this is a good vaping replication of authentic shisha double apple with that classic mild aniseed aftertaste that's ultra clean and exotic.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eWhats Included:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 x 30ml Nasty Shisha Salt Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSpecs and Features:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e50%PG \/ 50%VG, Low Mint\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in Malaysia\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChubby Gorilla Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e30ML Bottle Size\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41775189033015,"sku":"Nasty Shisha Double Apple - 50 mg","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"35mg","offer_id":41775189065783,"sku":"Nasty Shisha Double Apple - 35 Mg","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Nasty-Shisha-Salt-Double-Apple.jpg?v=1752510062","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/nasty-shisha-nic-salt-double-apple","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




